flowchart TD
  A["Tap to scan<br/>camera 1920x1080"] --> B["Picture check<br/>dark / glare / moving / blur dropped"]
  B --> C["ML Kit text + barcode<br/>(phone, offline)"]
  C --> D["Five zones merged over pictures<br/>Front, Ingredients, Codes, Shade, Around"]
  D --> E{"Barcode or exact name<br/>in phone index? score >= 0.86"}
  E -->|yes| K["Catalogue product<br/>+ admin's ingredient list"]
